{"noun":[{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/4f/25/91297_crt_8CjVR.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/4f/25/91297_crt_8CjVR.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/4f/25/91297_crt_8CjVR.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/4f/25/91297_crt_8CjVR.jpg"},"name":"あめちゃん","summary":"看上去老实乖巧，但很容易得意忘形任性起来，迫切想要得到认可的女孩。性格恶劣。喜欢的东西是阿P以及精神药物。\r\nWhile she may look somewhat low-key and quiet, she’s actually a ridiculously selfish and vapid girl with a tendency to get carried away and a desperate need for approval. She’s, well… kind of a garbage person. Likes: Her S.O./producer, “P-chan”; psychotropics.\r\n\r\n网络天使。糖糖开直播时的变装。装作性格乖巧的样子。很轻易就会向宅男们谄媚。\r\nAn “internet angel.” Ame-chan’s alter ego, used while streaming. Pretends to be really nice and sweet. Constantly flirts with otaku types.","relation":"主角","actors":[{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/c6/55/31776_prsn_fzgJz.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/c6/55/31776_prsn_fzgJz.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/c6/55/31776_prsn_fzgJz.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/c6/55/31776_prsn_fzgJz.jpg"},"name":"天城サリー","short_summary":"出生并成长于美国洛杉矶，双亲都是日本人。以声优为志向于2016年单人赴日。\r\n精通英语、日语以及西班牙语，也会说法语。\r\n2016年12月24日，在Aniplex等公司开办的「数字偶像声优Audition」中合格。\r\n口号是「根暗な明るいオタク、天城サリーです。食も笑顔もアメリカンサイズで頑張ります！」。","career":["artist","seiyu"],"id":31776,"type":1,"locked":false}],"type":1,"id":91297},{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/6a/b9/94414_crt_3LLLe.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/6a/b9/94414_crt_3LLLe.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/6a/b9/94414_crt_3LLLe.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/6a/b9/94414_crt_3LLLe.jpg"},"name":"超絶最かわてんしちゃん","summary":"超絶最かわてんしちゃん、通称「超てんちゃん」。\r\n配信や各種コラボなど彼女の活躍は多岐にわたり、幅広い世代から支持されている。\r\n令和のインターネットを救済する天使として、みんなをいつも見守っている。\r\n\r\n网络天使。糖糖开直播时的变装。装作性格乖巧的样子。很轻易就会向宅男们谄媚。\r\nAn “internet angel.” Ame-chan’s alter ego, used while streaming. Pretends to be really nice and sweet. Constantly flirts with otaku types.","relation":"主角","actors":[{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/c6/55/31776_prsn_fzgJz.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/c6/55/31776_prsn_fzgJz.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/c6/55/31776_prsn_fzgJz.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/c6/55/31776_prsn_fzgJz.jpg"},"name":"天城サリー","short_summary":"出生并成长于美国洛杉矶，双亲都是日本人。以声优为志向于2016年单人赴日。\r\n精通英语、日语以及西班牙语，也会说法语。\r\n2016年12月24日，在Aniplex等公司开办的「数字偶像声优Audition」中合格。\r\n口号是「根暗な明るいオタク、天城サリーです。食も笑顔もアメリカンサイズで頑張ります！」。","career":["artist","seiyu"],"id":31776,"type":1,"locked":false}],"type":1,"id":94414},{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/c8/5f/197931_crt_XHp4p.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/c8/5f/197931_crt_XHp4p.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/c8/5f/197931_crt_XHp4p.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/c8/5f/197931_crt_XHp4p.jpg"},"name":"パープル・ロリポップ","summary":"カラマーゾフのリーダー。猛毒電波少女。不敵な笑みをたたえる、新たな配信者。","relation":"主角","actors":[{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/48/1f/41365_prsn_F0RRZ.jpg?r=1723864344","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/48/1f/41365_prsn_F0RRZ.jpg?r=1723864344","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/48/1f/41365_prsn_F0RRZ.jpg?r=1723864344","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/48/1f/41365_prsn_F0RRZ.jpg?r=1723864344"},"name":"川口莉奈","short_summary":"青二プロダクション 所属\r\n\r\n出身地：埼玉県\r\n趣味：歌唱、イラスト、MMD、ダンス\r\n特技：紅茶を淹れ方、ドラム、口笛・歯笛","career":["seiyu"],"id":41365,"type":1,"locked":false}],"type":1,"id":197931},{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/ff/b4/197932_crt_4J9cX.jpg?r=1782811080","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/ff/b4/197932_crt_4J9cX.jpg?r=1782811080","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/ff/b4/197932_crt_4J9cX.jpg?r=1782811080","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/ff/b4/197932_crt_4J9cX.jpg?r=1782811080"},"name":"獄薔薇美血華","summary":"カラマーゾフのメンバー。ゴシックロリータ調の装いに身を包んでいる。","relation":"主角","actors":[{"images":{"small